# Copy to .env.staging.local (gitignored) and fill real staging keys from Supabase dashboard.
# Preferred for local/dev. Next.js loads .env.local by default — either:
#   A) Point .env.local at staging (same values as here), OR
#   B) Use .env.staging.local for scripts that merge it over .env.local
#      (verify-rewards-staging.mjs / stagingManualQa already prefer .env.staging.local).

